{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>If they see the land.</b> That they shall not see the land — like every ״אִם״ not followed by a repeated condition, such as ״אִם מִחוּט וְעַד שְׂרוֹךְ נַעַל וְאִם אֶקַּח מִכָּל אֲשֶׁר לָךְ״ (Genesis 14:23), ״חַי ה׳ אִם יוּמָת״ (1 Samuel 19:6), and their like." "<b>And all who spurn me shall not see it.</b> And even among their children who are not included in this decree — those who had not yet reached twenty years — all those who shall spurn Me in the future will not see it, as happened to those who died in the matter of Korah, and in the matter of Peor, and by the serpents and the fiery serpents."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:39:51.427664994Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}